(7434479, 1175264, 100393, '<td valign="top">Eclectic!</td>', 'Eclectic!', '2016-02-03 14:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434499, 1175335, 205, '<td valign="top">i like the tones but i think the composition has way too much sky.</td>', 'i like the tones but i think the composition has way too much sky.', '2016-02-03 16:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434500, 1175264, 42733, '<td valign="top">??</td>', '??', '2016-02-03 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434518, 1175088, 181814, '<td valign="top">I think the composition has a lot to be desired i.e. the deer should be in front of the shrubbery if that is the main subject.</td>', 'I think the composition has a lot to be desired i.e. the deer should be in front of the shrubbery if that is the main subject.', '2016-02-03 19:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434519, 1175264, 181814, '<td valign="top">I think you forgot to convert this to black and white and the focus is completely off.</td>', 'I think you forgot to convert this to black and white and the focus is completely off.', '2016-02-03 19:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434520, 1174907, 181814, '<td valign="top">I like the subject but I think the overall photograph is rather flat and not HDR at all. The focus is not very sharp either.</td>', 'I like the subject but I think the overall photograph is rather flat and not HDR at all. The focus is not very sharp either.', '2016-02-03 19:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434521, 1175048, 181814, '<td valign="top">I think you went a little overboard in the sharpening on most of the photograph and made it more obvious by blurring the top and bottom areas.</td>', 'I think you went a little overboard in the sharpening on most of the photograph and made it more obvious by blurring the top and bottom areas.', '2016-02-03 19:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434539, 1175283, 86447, '<td valign="top">Really?  You''re trying to convince us that you took several images... and then... added them all together to make one image with... more DOF than could normally happen?<br/> <br/>I hope you don''t get the brown.</td>', 'Really?  You''re trying to convince us that you took several images... and then... added them all together to make one image with... more DOF than could normally happen? I hope you don''t get the brown.', '2016-02-03 22:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434540, 1175291, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the image... but... not for the challenge topic.</td>', 'I love the image... but... not for the challenge topic.', '2016-02-03 22:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434541, 1175264, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nothing is in focus... And... I really need something to be in focus.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry.</td>', 'Nothing is in focus... And... I really need something to be in focus. I''m sorry.', '2016-02-03 22:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434542, 1175095, 86447, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS image!!   But... not for this challenge topic.</td>', 'GORGEOUS image!!   But... not for this challenge topic.', '2016-02-03 22:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434543, 1175375, 86447, '<td valign="top">I really, really want ... at least something... in focus.  *sigh*<br/> <br/>SORRY!</td>', 'I really, really want ... at least something... in focus.  *sigh* SORRY!', '2016-02-03 22:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434544, 1175260, 86447, '<td valign="top">What is the point of focus stacking... or... HDR ... and combing images... to get all of the details in one image... <br/> <br/>When all of the details can be gotten with one shot?<br/> <br/> <br/>I love the image... but... not for this challenge.</td>', 'What is the point of focus stacking... or... HDR ... and combing images... to get all of the details in one image...  When all of the details can be gotten with one shot?  I love the image... but... not for this challenge.', '2016-02-03 22:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434545, 1175292, 86447, '<td valign="top">What is the point of focus stacking... or... HDR ... and combing images... to get all of the details in one image... <br/> <br/>When all of the details can be gotten with one shot?<br/> <br/> <br/>I love the image... but... not for this challenge.<br/> <br/>This doesn''t look like HDR to me.  Sorry!!</td>', 'What is the point of focus stacking... or... HDR ... and combing images... to get all of the details in one image...  When all of the details can be gotten with one shot?  I love the image... but... not for this challenge. This doesn''t look like HDR to me.  Sorry!!', '2016-02-03 22:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434546, 1175364, 86447, '<td valign="top">WHoa!    WAY too much going on here for me.  My eyes hurt.<br/> <br/>Sorry!!</td>', 'WHoa!    WAY too much going on here for me.  My eyes hurt. Sorry!!', '2016-02-03 22:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434547, 1175253, 86447, '<td valign="top">Did you actually take several images to get more DOF in focus than you could have with just one shot?<br/> <br/>I''m questioning this.<br/> <br/>It''s a very flat plane.<br/> <br/>It''s a GORGEOUS image... just not good for this challenge topic.<br/>(IMHO)</td>', 'Did you actually take several images to get more DOF in focus than you could have with just one shot? I''m questioning this. It''s a very flat plane. It''s a GORGEOUS image... just not good for this challenge topic.(IMHO)', '2016-02-03 22:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434548, 1175234, 86447, '<td valign="top">FINALLY!!!  An image that fits the challenge topic!   Well done!!</td>', 'FINALLY!!!  An image that fits the challenge topic!   Well done!!', '2016-02-03 22:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434549, 1174969, 86447, '<td valign="top">What is the point of focus stacking... or... HDR ... and combing images... to get all of the details in one image... <br/> <br/>When all of the details can be gotten with one shot?<br/> <br/>Did you really create this image for an HDR challenge?</td>', 'What is the point of focus stacking... or... HDR ... and combing images... to get all of the details in one image...  When all of the details can be gotten with one shot? Did you really create this image for an HDR challenge?', '2016-02-03 22:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434550, 1175351, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fabulous!   Well done!!</td>', 'Fabulous!   Well done!!', '2016-02-03 22:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434551, 1175243, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!   Not sure if it''s perfect for the challenge topic, though.</td>', 'Beautiful image!   Not sure if it''s perfect for the challenge topic, though.', '2016-02-03 22:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434552, 1175370, 86447, '<td valign="top">So... did you actually take this image... several times... and combine them to give more of an "HDR" image for the challenge here?<br/> <br/>Seems odd to me...</td>', 'So... did you actually take this image... several times... and combine them to give more of an "HDR" image for the challenge here? Seems odd to me...', '2016-02-03 22:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434588, 1175204, 42733, '<td valign="top">Wow, great photo. My favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'Wow, great photo. My favorite in this challenge.', '2016-02-04 07:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434592, 1175228, 32117, '<td valign="top">Nice pic but the background is quite a distraction.</td>', 'Nice pic but the background is quite a distraction.', '2016-02-04 08:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434597, 1175346, 181814, '<td valign="top">This may be high-key but I would not classify it as HDR, the snow is completely blowout without showing any details, the focus seems to be off also.</td>', 'This may be high-key but I would not classify it as HDR, the snow is completely blowout without showing any details, the focus seems to be off also.', '2016-02-04 08:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434598, 1175348, 181814, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this would look better without the color toning and the texturing, I would like to see a clean sharp photograph displaying true HDR.</td>', 'In my opinion this would look better without the color toning and the texturing, I would like to see a clean sharp photograph displaying true HDR.', '2016-02-04 08:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434625, 1175048, 30669, '<td valign="top">Nice find. Perfect for HDR.</td>', 'Nice find. Perfect for HDR.', '2016-02-04 12:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434649, 1175001, 54446, '<td valign="top">Outstanding scene for HDR.  Amazing detail throughout, but especially on the shady side of the tree trunk.  The texture of the rocks on the shore is striking.  This is a really good example of complete DOF from toes to infinity.  Great job on the sky, with it''s pleasant tones and glorious detail of the cirrus clouds.  The asymmetrical composition is exceptionally eye-pleasing.  I so appreciate the horizon line above the vertical middle.</td>', 'Outstanding scene for HDR.  Amazing detail throughout, but especially on the shady side of the tree trunk.  The texture of the rocks on the shore is striking.  This is a really good example of complete DOF from toes to infinity.  Great job on the sky, with it''s pleasant tones and glorious detail of the cirrus clouds.  The asymmetrical composition is exceptionally eye-pleasing.  I so appreciate the horizon line above the vertical middle.', '2016-02-04 15:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434676, 1175264, 59029, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2016-02-04 19:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434677, 1175316, 59029, '<td valign="top">love this.  Looks almost like my place :-) 9</td>', 'love this.  Looks almost like my place :-) 9', '2016-02-04 19:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434678, 1175234, 181814, '<td valign="top">I really like the Yellow Cab and how it was processed, I think you have a lot of lens distortion, but overall this is a nice photograph.</td>', 'I really like the Yellow Cab and how it was processed, I think you have a lot of lens distortion, but overall this is a nice photograph.', '2016-02-04 19:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434679, 1175139, 59029, '<td valign="top">ooh pretty...and I''m getting dizzy...9</td>', 'ooh pretty...and I''m getting dizzy...9', '2016-02-04 19:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434680, 1175260, 181814, '<td valign="top">Here is what I like about this photograph: Great composition, extremely nice focus, very nicely processed and that it looks HDR i.e. shows all the different shade without losing any details by either dark shadows or blown out highlights. The horizon is level and everything is clean and sharp for the most part.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like: This is just a nit-pick but there seems to be a lot of noise showing in the clouds.<br/> <br/>This is very nice and I hope it does well.</td>', 'Here is what I like about this photograph: Great composition, extremely nice focus, very nicely processed and that it looks HDR i.e. shows all the different shade without losing any details by either dark shadows or blown out highlights. The horizon is level and everything is clean and sharp for the most part. What I don''t like: This is just a nit-pick but there seems to be a lot of noise showing in the clouds. This is very nice and I hope it does well.', '2016-02-04 19:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434682, 1174933, 181814, '<td valign="top">What I like: The composition is very well done and the focus is spot on. I do wonder why the sky is black because it looks like the sun is shining or you have some very strong lights, the light colored rock formation does look good against the black background.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like: I really can''t see anything that stands out with the exception the highlights are a little strong wiping out some of the textures in the cactus and the rock formation.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'What I like: The composition is very well done and the focus is spot on. I do wonder why the sky is black because it looks like the sun is shining or you have some very strong lights, the light colored rock formation does look good against the black background. What I don''t like: I really can''t see anything that stands out with the exception the highlights are a little strong wiping out some of the textures in the cactus and the rock formation. Good luck.', '2016-02-04 19:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434683, 1175371, 181814, '<td valign="top">What I like: This would be just another everyday mountain range if it weren''t for the waterfall well composed in the background, I also like the clouds/fog throughout the photograph. The processing seems to be very well done also.</td>', 'What I like: This would be just another everyday mountain range if it weren''t for the waterfall well composed in the background, I also like the clouds/fog throughout the photograph. The processing seems to be very well done also.', '2016-02-04 19:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434685, 1175001, 181814, '<td valign="top">What I like: First the post-processing is well done, I like the fact that you captured the old tree in the foreground and that the photograph is sharp and well focused throughout. Looks like a pleasant place to spend the day. I see something in the water maybe a dog or something right in the middle that gets my mind wondering what it actually is.I like that you didn''t go to extremes and that it looks very natural.</td>', 'What I like: First the post-processing is well done, I like the fact that you captured the old tree in the foreground and that the photograph is sharp and well focused throughout. Looks like a pleasant place to spend the day. I see something in the water maybe a dog or something right in the middle that gets my mind wondering what it actually is.I like that you didn''t go to extremes and that it looks very natural.', '2016-02-04 19:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434686, 1174986, 181814, '<td valign="top">What I like: I am a fan of solitary trees and this is a beauty for sure. I like the composition and focus and that the photograph is clean throughout.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like: I think you processed it just a bit to much which eliminated some of the details in the shadows and blew out some of the highlights. It is an overall nice looking photograph.</td>', 'What I like: I am a fan of solitary trees and this is a beauty for sure. I like the composition and focus and that the photograph is clean throughout. What I don''t like: I think you processed it just a bit to much which eliminated some of the details in the shadows and blew out some of the highlights. It is an overall nice looking photograph.', '2016-02-04 19:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434687, 1175200, 181814, '<td valign="top">What I like: The overall photograph is pleasant to look at, I like the composition and all the lines, the focus is very well done. I like the color toning.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like: I personally think by making it brighter just a bit would help out but this is just a nit-pick on my part.</td>', 'What I like: The overall photograph is pleasant to look at, I like the composition and all the lines, the focus is very well done. I like the color toning. What I don''t like: I personally think by making it brighter just a bit would help out but this is just a nit-pick on my part.', '2016-02-04 19:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434688, 1175316, 181814, '<td valign="top">What I like: I like old western towns and you found a good location for sure. Your post- processing is very well done and I like the horse framed in the window.The exposure is really good.</td>', 'What I like: I like old western towns and you found a good location for sure. Your post- processing is very well done and I like the horse framed in the window.The exposure is really good.', '2016-02-04 19:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434693, 1174976, 181814, '<td valign="top">What I like: The composition is good as is the focus, the exposure is also very well done.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like: I would rather see this is complete black and white but your toning is okay. I don''t really like the person posing in the lower right side of the frame, my eyes keep going back to that area. I would even consider cropping the entire bottom half out just to see how it looks.</td>', 'What I like: The composition is good as is the focus, the exposure is also very well done. What I don''t like: I would rather see this is complete black and white but your toning is okay. I don''t really like the person posing in the lower right side of the frame, my eyes keep going back to that area. I would even consider cropping the entire bottom half out just to see how it looks.', '2016-02-04 19:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434697, 1175313, 181814, '<td valign="top">What I like: The composition is great, I like the geese flying by in the sky, the focus is really well done.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like: You have captured a large part of the sky and there seems to be a lot of noise showing, I think the post-processing could be better because some of the details in the shadow area are missing. <br/> <br/>Overall very nice photograph.</td>', 'What I like: The composition is great, I like the geese flying by in the sky, the focus is really well done. What I don''t like: You have captured a large part of the sky and there seems to be a lot of noise showing, I think the post-processing could be better because some of the details in the shadow area are missing.  Overall very nice photograph.', '2016-02-04 19:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434700, 1175310, 181814, '<td valign="top">What I like: This is very well compost and interesting to look at. I think it may be just a bit over exposed, but still good.</td>', 'What I like: This is very well compost and interesting to look at. I think it may be just a bit over exposed, but still good.', '2016-02-04 19:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434701, 1175289, 181814, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph with excellent focus and nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice photograph with excellent focus and nice composition.', '2016-02-04 20:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434703, 1175282, 181814, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this works that well with this type of contest, it looks a bit bland in my opinion.</td>', 'I don''t think this works that well with this type of contest, it looks a bit bland in my opinion.', '2016-02-04 20:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434704, 1175375, 181814, '<td valign="top">This could have been much better if it were in focus and with less noise. I really don''t think moving objects turnout that good for HDR.</td>', 'This could have been much better if it were in focus and with less noise. I really don''t think moving objects turnout that good for HDR.', '2016-02-04 20:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434705, 1175321, 181814, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this works that well in this sort of contest, if you are going to take a closeup then it would probably look better with out the white dots/specks on the metal surrface. I really don''t consider this to be HDR.</td>', 'I don''t know if this works that well in this sort of contest, if you are going to take a closeup then it would probably look better with out the white dots/specks on the metal surrface. I really don''t consider this to be HDR.', '2016-02-04 20:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434706, 1175370, 181814, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this may have been better in another type of contest, it really doesn''t look that impressive as far as HDR goes.</td>', 'In my opinion this may have been better in another type of contest, it really doesn''t look that impressive as far as HDR goes.', '2016-02-04 20:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434707, 1174835, 181814, '<td valign="top">This photograph does not look very realistic at all and it doesn''t strike me as being HDR but some sort of filter that turned it into a sketch.</td>', 'This photograph does not look very realistic at all and it doesn''t strike me as being HDR but some sort of filter that turned it into a sketch.', '2016-02-04 20:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434709, 1175283, 181814, '<td valign="top">I really don''t see this as an HDR photograph because it looks very soft and flat, not to mention it is completely out of focus.</td>', 'I really don''t see this as an HDR photograph because it looks very soft and flat, not to mention it is completely out of focus.', '2016-02-04 20:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434915, 1175350, 30861, '<td valign="top">The ambiguity of scale here is fantastic. The HDR is used as I like to see it used, in the manner of a zone system print. Bumping to top group.</td>', 'The ambiguity of scale here is fantastic. The HDR is used as I like to see it used, in the manner of a zone system print. Bumping to top group.', '2016-02-05 11:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434916, 1175200, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous composition.</td>', 'Gorgeous composition.', '2016-02-05 11:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434917, 1175150, 30861, '<td valign="top">The HDR is used as I like to see it used, in the manner of a zone system print. From my perspective the scene through the door may be just a tad bit TOO dark, I''d like to see it half a zone brighter for a more "realistic" sense of drawing-out.</td>', 'The HDR is used as I like to see it used, in the manner of a zone system print. From my perspective the scene through the door may be just a tad bit TOO dark, I''d like to see it half a zone brighter for a more "realistic" sense of drawing-out.', '2016-02-05 11:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434919, 1174933, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a striking image. The relatively flat light isn''t doing you any favors. The super-black sky is a love/hate thing. Certainly, back in the day, if I shot this on film with a deep-red filter I''d get a sky like that, and it''s graphic as heck, but it sort of feels a bit much to me right now.</td>', 'This is a striking image. The relatively flat light isn''t doing you any favors. The super-black sky is a love/hate thing. Certainly, back in the day, if I shot this on film with a deep-red filter I''d get a sky like that, and it''s graphic as heck, but it sort of feels a bit much to me right now.', '2016-02-05 11:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434920, 1175234, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is top-notch night-time HDR work. It''s a situation where the more-aggressive tone mapping works well. Bumping to top group.</td>', 'This is top-notch night-time HDR work. It''s a situation where the more-aggressive tone mapping works well. Bumping to top group.', '2016-02-05 11:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434921, 1174851, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully dramatic scene. The HDR is used as I like to see it used, in the manner of a zone system print. I do wonder if the darkest areas need a little more structure to render to best advantage on the monitor, but I''m sure this PRINTS spectacularly well. The rendering of the clouds is absolutely palpable, I want to drift into that softness and ride the moon to another country not my own :-) Bumping to top group.</td>', 'Wonderfully dramatic scene. The HDR is used as I like to see it used, in the manner of a zone system print. I do wonder if the darkest areas need a little more structure to render to best advantage on the monitor, but I''m sure this PRINTS spectacularly well. The rendering of the clouds is absolutely palpable, I want to drift into that softness and ride the moon to another country not my own :-) Bumping to top group.', '2016-02-05 11:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434922, 1175196, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very hard thing to do (I absolutely KNOW), this business of rendering backlit snow. This is very well done. Lovely scene. Bumping.</td>', 'Very hard thing to do (I absolutely KNOW), this business of rendering backlit snow. This is very well done. Lovely scene. Bumping.', '2016-02-05 12:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434923, 1174982, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, almost-metallic tonalities here. Gracefully rendered and presented. Bumping.</td>', 'Gorgeous, almost-metallic tonalities here. Gracefully rendered and presented. Bumping.', '2016-02-05 12:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434924, 1175243, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very nice night-time HDR, soft and muted. Dark areas well-rendered for the desired mood. Interesting how the construction crane, which some might consider a distraction, and which could have been cloned out legally, ADDS something in my eyes. Well-seen!</td>', 'Very nice night-time HDR, soft and muted. Dark areas well-rendered for the desired mood. Interesting how the construction crane, which some might consider a distraction, and which could have been cloned out legally, ADDS something in my eyes. Well-seen!', '2016-02-05 12:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434925, 1175342, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautifully-rendered except for a hint of radial banding in the sky. Peaceful, perfectly-balanced image.</td>', 'Beautifully-rendered except for a hint of radial banding in the sky. Peaceful, perfectly-balanced image.', '2016-02-05 12:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434926, 1175335, 30861, '<td valign="top">The HDR is used as I like to see it used, in the manner of a zone system print. Very nice rendering technically, but for me the composition is a bit static with the gantry smack in the center; it fights against the converging diagonal sweeps of sky and pier. Bump.</td>', 'The HDR is used as I like to see it used, in the manner of a zone system print. Very nice rendering technically, but for me the composition is a bit static with the gantry smack in the center; it fights against the converging diagonal sweeps of sky and pier. Bump.', '2016-02-05 12:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434927, 1175369, 30861, '<td valign="top">The HDR is used as I like to see it used, in the manner of a zone system print. I love the symmetrical-but-asymmetrical nature of the composition. I wish the taxi weren''t there, so left and right BGs balanced, but it is what it is I guess :-) Bumping.</td>', 'The HDR is used as I like to see it used, in the manner of a zone system print. I love the symmetrical-but-asymmetrical nature of the composition. I wish the taxi weren''t there, so left and right BGs balanced, but it is what it is I guess :-) Bumping.', '2016-02-05 12:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434928, 1175371, 30861, '<td valign="top">How iconic can you get? :-) I couldn''t even count the number of times I''ve done this viewpoint myself, and it always thrills. Beautiful rendering on the clouds. Overall the image could use a tad more structure, maybe? Bumping.</td>', 'How iconic can you get? :-) I couldn''t even count the number of times I''ve done this viewpoint myself, and it always thrills. Beautiful rendering on the clouds. Overall the image could use a tad more structure, maybe? Bumping.', '2016-02-05 12:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434929, 1175095, 30861, '<td valign="top">Not really reading as "HDR" to me, but nevertheless the tones are handled beautifully here, which is the goal. Striking work! Bumping.</td>', 'Not really reading as "HDR" to me, but nevertheless the tones are handled beautifully here, which is the goal. Striking work! Bumping.', '2016-02-05 12:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434930, 1175253, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image. It has more of a high-contrast look than HDR, so it  probably isn''t scoring well, but it''s nevertheless a beautiful rendering and deserves some love :-)</td>', 'This is a lovely image. It has more of a high-contrast look than HDR, so it  probably isn''t scoring well, but it''s nevertheless a beautiful rendering and deserves some love :-)', '2016-02-05 12:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
