(7435255, 1175048, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really love this shot. The perspective and processing is spot on. The blur you added to the top of the photograph is just to distracting, really should have left it alone.</td>', 'Really love this shot. The perspective and processing is spot on. The blur you added to the top of the photograph is just to distracting, really should have left it alone.', '2016-02-07 09:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
