(7436173, 1174969, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is what I was hoping to see more of in this challenge. Rich tones, thoughtful contrast, interesting forms. A touch of risk, a bit of intrigue, a hint of adventure ... all keep me interested &amp; looking. How you achieved this enchanting result is a question that never occurred to me.</td>', 'This is what I was hoping to see more of in this challenge. Rich tones, thoughtful contrast, interesting forms. A touch of risk, a bit of intrigue, a hint of adventure ... all keep me interested & looking. How you achieved this enchanting result is a question that never occurred to me.', '2016-02-10 00:52:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7436181, 1175370, 63218, '<td valign="top">Oh don''t be sorry--this is delightful.  I hope you do more of them--keep on taking advantage of in-camera HDR, your camera is helping you. Look how rich &amp; lively the tonal range is--not a flat grey anywhere. The implied movement adds additional interest. I would be very pleased to capture this.</td>', 'Oh don''t be sorry--this is delightful.  I hope you do more of them--keep on taking advantage of in-camera HDR, your camera is helping you. Look how rich & lively the tonal range is--not a flat grey anywhere. The implied movement adds additional interest. I would be very pleased to capture this.', '2016-02-10 01:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
